OVERVIEW: Batch process multiple DICOM files

Process multiple DICOM files efficiently with batch inference.

Example:
  dicom-ai batch series/*.dcm --model classifier.mlmodel --output results.csv
--format csv

USAGE: dicom-ai batch [<files> ...] --model <model> --output <output> [--format <format>] [--batch-size <batch-size>] [--confidence <confidence>] [--force] [--verbose]

ARGUMENTS:
  <files>                 DICOM files to process

OPTIONS:
  -m, --model <model>     CoreML model file path
  -o, --output <output>   Output file path
  -f, --format <format>   Output format: json, csv (values: json, csv; default:
                          csv)
  --batch-size <batch-size>
                          Batch size for inference (default: 1)
  --confidence <confidence>
                          Minimum confidence threshold (default: 0.5)
  --force                 Force parsing of files without DICM prefix
  --verbose               Verbose output
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

